WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.055 --> 00:00:03.641
"We have to find that truck," Detective Smith said.

2
00:00:03.642 --> 00:00:06.631
"The driver is a few miles north . . . Rocket Girl?

3
00:00:06.632 --> 00:00:11.254
Oh! You're still here. You usually fly away."

4
00:00:11.255 --> 00:00:14.955
"I'm too confused to fly right now," Roxy said.

5
00:00:14.956 --> 00:00:18.851
"Did you say Quake Man stole a banana truck?"

6
00:00:18.852 --> 00:00:20.632
Detective Smith nodded.

7
00:00:20.633 --> 00:00:25.871
Roxy scratched her head. "Why is he stealing mattresses and bananas?"

8
00:00:25.872 --> 00:00:29.510
The detective shrugged. "It is pretty weird."

9
00:00:29.511 --> 00:00:32.351
Vroom! A truck zoomed by.

10
00:00:32.352 --> 00:00:35.349
A banana was painted on the side.

11
00:00:35.350 --> 00:00:40.501
Roxy gasped. "Is that Quake Man?"

12
00:00:40.502 --> 00:00:43.263
Roxy followed the truck.

13
00:00:43.264 --> 00:00:46.444
The truck soon left the highway.

14
00:00:46.445 --> 00:00:48.908
It drove into a neighborhood.

15
00:00:48.909 --> 00:00:51.032
The driver looked out the window.

16
00:00:51.033 --> 00:00:54.076
He saw Roxy and drove faster.

17
00:00:54.077 --> 00:00:56.501
"That's suspicious!" Roxy thought.

18
00:00:56.502 --> 00:00:58.895
"He must be Quake Man!"

19
00:00:58.896 --> 00:01:02.904
The speeding truck almost hit someone.

20
00:01:02.905 --> 00:01:06.624
Roxy grabbed the truck and stopped it.

21
00:01:06.625 --> 00:01:09.473
The driver jumped out.

22
00:01:09.474 --> 00:01:12.089
His right arm looked like a jackhammer.

23
00:01:12.090 --> 00:01:17.145
"Rocket Girl! How dare you stop Quake Man!"

24
00:01:17.146 --> 00:01:20.733
"You're under arrest!" Roxy said.

25
00:01:20.734 --> 00:01:23.712
"Nobody arrests Quake Man!"

26
00:01:23.713 --> 00:01:27.104
The villain pressed a button on his jackhammer arm.

27
00:01:27.105 --> 00:01:31.312
Brak-ak-ak! Brak-ak-ak! The arm pounded the street.

28
00:01:31.313 --> 00:01:34.730
The street shook. Chunks of pavement broke loose.

29
00:01:34.731 --> 00:01:38.314
"Whoa!" Roxy lost her balance.

30
00:01:38.315 --> 00:01:40.146
Quake Man pumped his fist.

31
00:01:40.147 --> 00:01:44.210
"Yes! Quake Man is an excellent villain!"

32
00:01:44.211 --> 00:01:47.529
A traffic light fell over and crashed onto the street.

33
00:01:47.530 --> 00:01:50.235
A taxi skidded.

34
00:01:50.236 --> 00:01:53.332
Bang! A second car hit the taxi.

35
00:01:53.333 --> 00:01:55.730
The sidewalk split apart.

36
00:01:55.731 --> 00:02:00.013
A group of people fell into the crack.

37
00:02:00.014 --> 00:02:01.712
"Ahh!"

38
00:02:01.713 --> 00:02:03.657
"Help!"

39
00:02:03.658 --> 00:02:05.871
Quake Man gulped.

40
00:02:05.872 --> 00:02:08.711
"Oh boy. I didn't mean to do that."

41
00:02:08.712 --> 00:02:11.154
Roxy flew over and looked down.

42
00:02:11.155 --> 00:02:14.887
She saw a woman dusting herself off.

43
00:02:14.888 --> 00:02:17.872
"Are you okay?" Roxy asked.

44
00:02:17.873 --> 00:02:22.667
"We're okay," the woman said. "But we're stuck down here!"

45
00:02:22.668 --> 00:02:27.498
"Don't worry," Roxy said. "I'll get you all out!"

46
00:02:27.499 --> 00:02:36.113
Quake Man bit his lip. He got back in the truck and drove off.

47
00:02:36.114 --> 00:02:39.354
He soon arrived at a warehouse.

48
00:02:39.355 --> 00:02:42.812
He drove in and parked next to the mattress truck.

49
00:02:42.813 --> 00:02:44.987
The warehouse was filled with stuff.

50
00:02:44.988 --> 00:02:48.472
There were socks, folding chairs, and buckets of paint.

51
00:02:48.473 --> 00:02:51.937
Big bags of dog food sat near boxes of paper towels.

52
00:02:51.938 --> 00:02:55.685
There were other things too. None of it was valuable.

53
00:02:55.686 --> 00:02:58.186
Quake Man opened the back of the truck.

54
00:02:58.187 --> 00:03:00.295
He slapped his forehead.

55
00:03:00.296 --> 00:03:03.366
"Bananas!" He groaned.

56
00:03:03.367 --> 00:03:06.195
"There's even a banana on the side of the truck!

57
00:03:06.196 --> 00:03:11.147
Why didn't I see that?"

58
00:03:11.148 --> 00:03:13.973
Quake Man flopped onto a mattress.

59
00:03:13.974 --> 00:03:16.927
"I'm a terrible villain.

60
00:03:16.928 --> 00:03:21.681
And I almost hurt those people." He sighed.

61
00:03:21.682 --> 00:03:26.891
"Quake Man stinks."

